WEBVTT

00:31:54.917 --> 00:32:00.268
CF: The idea of the need
to have economic diversification

00:32:00.292 --> 00:32:02.726
came up during that flight.

00:32:02.750 --> 00:32:05.059
It was sort of an aha moment for them.

00:32:05.083 --> 00:32:06.684
AG: Meaning that for Saudi Arabia

00:32:06.708 --> 00:32:08.768
to move forward
with the climate agreement,

00:32:08.792 --> 00:32:11.434
they had to get support
to diversify their economy,

00:32:11.458 --> 00:32:13.726
to be able to invest
in other national exports

00:32:13.750 --> 00:32:16.101
and have the world support them in it.

00:32:16.125 --> 00:32:18.018
CF: That famous little napkin

00:32:18.042 --> 00:32:21.226
on which the negotiator
pulled out in the airplane

00:32:21.250 --> 00:32:23.059
and wrote "economic diversification"

00:32:23.083 --> 00:32:28.559
and made a little design for me
of how that might work,

00:32:28.583 --> 00:32:33.018
that's why economic diversification
is literally embedded